  "description": "Han Seo-won, a female theater actor who is outstanding in acting skills but fails every audition she sees in a low voice that is often mistaken for a man, too tall for a woman. Even if you don't have recognition, you don't have too much, so you deceive gender in a historical drama while you're in a trick, audition, and then be cast unconventionally. Her role is the 'King of Seogong' of the Unified Silla period. In history, he ascends to the throne at a young age and makes various achievements in culture and science, He is a king of bad luck who faces a sad death at a young age due to the rebellion of his opponent. Ahead of the long-awaited first filming, Seowon transcends time and space, changing his body with the \"King Seogong\" in history.\n\n**Original Webtoon:**  \n[KakaoPage](https://page.kakao.com/content/55719981), [Ridibooks](https://ridibooks.com/books/1434015988), [MrBlue](https://www.mrblue.com/webtoon/wt_000054991), [Naver Series](https://series.naver.com/comic/detail.series?productNo=9125623), [Bomtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/LION_S2), [Lezhin](https://www.lezhin.com/ko/comic/lion_heart), [Onestory](https://onestory.co.kr/detail/H043611097), [Nate](https://toonnbook.nate.com/detail/H043611097), [BookCube](https://www.bookcube.com/toon/detail.asp?webtoon_num=220780), [Toomics](https://www.toomics.com/webtoon/episode/toon/7670)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \n[French](https://www.lezhinfr.com/detail/daf_1000622)",
